(4749015, 683217, 57936, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective, but it would be better if both were entirely in the frame and if more of the tops were in focus. This appears to be a common theme in this challenge with similar technical errors. This is one of the better ones.</td>', 'Interesting perspective, but it would be better if both were entirely in the frame and if more of the tops were in focus. This appears to be a common theme in this challenge with similar technical errors. This is one of the better ones.', '2008-06-04 15:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
