(4749022, 684828, 57936, '<td valign="top">A bit soft, especially around the dog''s face, but also the girls eyes, mouth, and hands. Nice idea and well composed.</td>', 'A bit soft, especially around the dog''s face, but also the girls eyes, mouth, and hands. Nice idea and well composed.', '2008-06-04 15:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
