(4749050, 685303, 57936, '<td valign="top">This would be truly great if you cropped it (vertical) at the point where you used "Burn" to frame it and got rid of the distracting black edges and digital frame. The faces on the couple, clarity, and lighting are all PRIMO! Still a 9!</td>', 'This would be truly great if you cropped it (vertical) at the point where you used "Burn" to frame it and got rid of the distracting black edges and digital frame. The faces on the couple, clarity, and lighting are all PRIMO! Still a 9!', '2008-06-04 15:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
