(4752230, 685295, 70265, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft portrait. I love the colors. If the background was just a tad more out-of-focus, and you cropped out the left tree, that would put it over the top. But I''m being picky. Still an 8.</td>', 'Beautiful soft portrait. I love the colors. If the background was just a tad more out-of-focus, and you cropped out the left tree, that would put it over the top. But I''m being picky. Still an 8.', '2008-06-05 17:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4752231, 684879, 93765, '<td valign="top">You seem to have a DOF problem - the flowers are not in focus, but the leaves are. I am afraid you also overdid it on the processing. The composition is not bad, but the overall effect is a bit - overwhelming. If you got all exited with the possibilities in your editing program, relax a bit. Not all settings have to be at the extreme. If you specifically wanted this effect - fair enough.</td>', 'You seem to have a DOF problem - the flowers are not in focus, but the leaves are. I am afraid you also overdid it on the processing. The composition is not bad, but the overall effect is a bit - overwhelming. If you got all exited with the possibilities in your editing program, relax a bit. Not all settings have to be at the extreme. If you specifically wanted this effect - fair enough.', '2008-06-05 17:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4752232, 685381, 70265, '<td valign="top">hilarious</td>', 'hilarious', '2008-06-05 17:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4752234, 684857, 70265, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. love the colors, composition, DOF. My only gripe id that I can''t quite make out the white objects. What are they? I still love the shot though.</td>', 'Gorgeous. love the colors, composition, DOF. My only gripe id that I can''t quite make out the white objects. What are they? I still love the shot though.', '2008-06-05 17:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
