(4754290, 685333, 69325, '<td valign="top">Hey Sof! the pepper is a little too hidden in the background and the border does not help in this case. also, (and you may be getting comments on this) people seemed to be turned off by long titles, especially ones that try to explain the picture. choose a short title and let the photo speak for itself.</td>', 'Hey Sof! the pepper is a little too hidden in the background and the border does not help in this case. also, (and you may be getting comments on this) people seemed to be turned off by long titles, especially ones that try to explain the picture. choose a short title and let the photo speak for itself.', '2008-06-06 14:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
