(4754655, 685303, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Very intimate. The rectangular highlight is an interesting way to frame the subjects. Nice exposure of whites in bright sun... my guess is that it was difficult to get those right.</td>', 'Great shot. Very intimate. The rectangular highlight is an interesting way to frame the subjects. Nice exposure of whites in bright sun... my guess is that it was difficult to get those right.', '2008-06-06 18:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
