(4754658, 685456, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, although I''m not sure I get your intentions on the texture and grain. The grain is distracting for me.</td>', 'Nice capture, although I''m not sure I get your intentions on the texture and grain. The grain is distracting for me.', '2008-06-06 18:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
