(4754663, 684895, 67237, '<td valign="top">nice subject for the challenge...I wish the composition was more interesting though.....maybe a longer shooting distance showing them in a curve with some nice perspective.</td>', 'nice subject for the challenge...I wish the composition was more interesting though.....maybe a longer shooting distance showing them in a curve with some nice perspective.', '2008-06-06 18:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
