(4754668, 685381, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! Those are some intense expressions! I love how the person on the right''s body stretches through much of the frame, yet stays within the borders... also the airborne aspect. Great representation of partners! (although those appear to be badminton racquets on a tennis court)</td>', 'Wow! Those are some intense expressions! I love how the person on the right''s body stretches through much of the frame, yet stays within the borders... also the airborne aspect. Great representation of partners! (although those appear to be badminton racquets on a tennis court)', '2008-06-06 18:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
