(4754676, 685405, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, great sharpness on the eye and claws. Not sure it feels like a ''partner'' shot though.</td>', 'Nice capture, great sharpness on the eye and claws. Not sure it feels like a ''partner'' shot though.', '2008-06-06 18:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
