(4754682, 684439, 67237, '<td valign="top">I like her expression. She is scared!!!<br/>The concept expressed in the title kind of fits the challenge...but this is a photo contest, and the image by itself does not transmit a mutually benefitial relationship. I have some issues with the processing: wb looks off, reds are over saturated and the bg is a way overexposed. These issues could have been solved under advanced editying rules.</td>', 'I like her expression. She is scared!!!The concept expressed in the title kind of fits the challenge...but this is a photo contest, and the image by itself does not transmit a mutually benefitial relationship. I have some issues with the processing: wb looks off, reds are over saturated and the bg is a way overexposed. These issues could have been solved under advanced editying rules.', '2008-06-06 18:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4754684, 685415, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the frozen moment... facial expression / head tilt, right hand outstretched, dust in the air, knee slightly  off the ground, chest protector shifted.<br/> <br/>Interesting interpretion and a good shot!</td>', 'I love the frozen moment... facial expression / head tilt, right hand outstretched, dust in the air, knee slightly  off the ground, chest protector shifted. Interesting interpretion and a good shot!', '2008-06-06 18:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
