(4755016, 685359, 12661, '<td valign="top">I looked around a bit before realizing the other half of the partnership. It could have worked better if the cheese was more unique. What you have looks like butter patties. Perhaps a round of Chevre or a wedge of Gruyere would do.</td>', 'I looked around a bit before realizing the other half of the partnership. It could have worked better if the cheese was more unique. What you have looks like butter patties. Perhaps a round of Chevre or a wedge of Gruyere would do.', '2008-06-06 23:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755020, 685381, 12661, '<td valign="top">I''m obviously loosing too much of my wit.  My first thought was, but that''s a tennis net, not badminton. Not until a few seconds later did it hit me that was the whole point.</td>', 'I''m obviously loosing too much of my wit.  My first thought was, but that''s a tennis net, not badminton. Not until a few seconds later did it hit me that was the whole point.', '2008-06-06 23:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755033, 684187, 12661, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit of a shoehorn for this challenge, but regardless, a brilliantly creative eye. To see the proportional similarity between the post and tower takes talent. The bird droppings on the lamp post also adds a humbling sense to it as it aspire to greatness.<br/> <br/>To improve the image... I think a smaller aperture would help bring both foreground and background into focus. Also, a UV and/or polarizing filter could help cut through the haze which is robbing you photo of much contrast.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit of a shoehorn for this challenge, but regardless, a brilliantly creative eye. To see the proportional similarity between the post and tower takes talent. The bird droppings on the lamp post also adds a humbling sense to it as it aspire to greatness. To improve the image... I think a smaller aperture would help bring both foreground and background into focus. Also, a UV and/or polarizing filter could help cut through the haze which is robbing you photo of much contrast.', '2008-06-06 23:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755043, 684862, 12661, '<td valign="top">This photo may hold the record for most screams from voters as they click through the images. This is a very interesting shot with excellent color and lighting. I am not convinced that using a centered composition was the best idea hear, particularly the area to the left. It may work well without it.<br/> <br/>Subject wise, definite bonus point for capturing something I have NEVER seen before.</td>', 'This photo may hold the record for most screams from voters as they click through the images. This is a very interesting shot with excellent color and lighting. I am not convinced that using a centered composition was the best idea hear, particularly the area to the left. It may work well without it. Subject wise, definite bonus point for capturing something I have NEVER seen before.', '2008-06-06 23:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755083, 684781, 71657, '<td valign="top">this is quite a stretch</td>', 'this is quite a stretch', '2008-06-06 23:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755085, 683743, 71657, '<td valign="top">blown out in rear</td>', 'blown out in rear', '2008-06-06 23:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755191, 685385, 54645, '<td valign="top">I''ve considered this image for a whopping several minutes...brace yourself...I don''t think this image is very good. I get the concept of the subject. DOF is poor. Lighting is too harsh. Composition does nothing to represent the partnership of a hand and glove in an intriguing fashion. This particularly subject would need more environmental context to make it interesting. 3</td>', 'I''ve considered this image for a whopping several minutes...brace yourself...I don''t think this image is very good. I get the concept of the subject. DOF is poor. Lighting is too harsh. Composition does nothing to represent the partnership of a hand and glove in an intriguing fashion. This particularly subject would need more environmental context to make it interesting. 3', '2008-06-07 01:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755193, 684520, 54645, '<td valign="top">pleasant feeling, great emotion, too many hot spots in the shoulders</td>', 'pleasant feeling, great emotion, too many hot spots in the shoulders', '2008-06-07 01:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755194, 685237, 54645, '<td valign="top">or I''ll push..." This is actually an interesting environmental portrait/candid.  Still seems a bit flat, but it looks like mid day and the haze is tough.</td>', 'or I''ll push..." This is actually an interesting environmental portrait/candid.  Still seems a bit flat, but it looks like mid day and the haze is tough.', '2008-06-07 01:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4755260, 685445, 70514, '<td valign="top">This has made my day!  I don''t have twins, but two girls... they can really make/break it, huh?  I LOVE the nostalgic feel to your processing, the love, the expressions, it''s all wonderful.</td>', 'This has made my day!  I don''t have twins, but two girls... they can really make/break it, huh?  I LOVE the nostalgic feel to your processing, the love, the expressions, it''s all wonderful.', '2008-06-07 02:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
