(4758804, 683404, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful and artfully done.</td>', 'Very beautiful and artfully done.', '2008-06-09 01:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4758983, 685237, 91076, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for the GC, but I struggle to see a partnership.  Difficult landscape - the colours are a pretty washed out with the distance and sun.  Maybe a better result if you get the chance to shoot earlier or later.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for the GC, but I struggle to see a partnership.  Difficult landscape - the colours are a pretty washed out with the distance and sun.  Maybe a better result if you get the chance to shoot earlier or later.', '2008-06-09 03:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4758986, 684707, 91076, '<td valign="top">Where''s the carbon?  I might have let you get away with it if you called it Hydrogen and Oxygen, but would still struggle to meet the challenge.  Beautiful though.  Wrong challenge, imo.  Hope others are less picky.</td>', 'Where''s the carbon?  I might have let you get away with it if you called it Hydrogen and Oxygen, but would still struggle to meet the challenge.  Beautiful though.  Wrong challenge, imo.  Hope others are less picky.', '2008-06-09 04:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759027, 685409, 48389, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting in this challenge, just offering up a, hopefully, helpful critique..<br/> <br/>The lighting on the flower and butterfly are really nice ahd help to make the yellow of the flower really pop. I''m in two minds about the colour of the background but have come to the decision that it doesn''t detract from the image.<br/> <br/>The only thing I can see that might be causing the voters to be a little unkind is that the butterflies head isn''t completely in focus. But, it''s only a small part of an overall well lit, nicely composed image...I give up with the voters here :o(<br/> <br/>Hope this helps :o)</td>', 'I''m not voting in this challenge, just offering up a, hopefully, helpful critique.. The lighting on the flower and butterfly are really nice ahd help to make the yellow of the flower really pop. I''m in two minds about the colour of the background but have come to the decision that it doesn''t detract from the image. The only thing I can see that might be causing the voters to be a little unkind is that the butterflies head isn''t completely in focus. But, it''s only a small part of an overall well lit, nicely composed image...I give up with the voters here :o( Hope this helps :o)', '2008-06-09 05:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759089, 683777, 37252, '<td valign="top">Love the way the fence/path leads my eye through the image. The kids holding hands is classic. The negative here is the sky color - looks very artificial in tone and has color banding that appears to be from the pp.</td>', 'Love the way the fence/path leads my eye through the image. The kids holding hands is classic. The negative here is the sky color - looks very artificial in tone and has color banding that appears to be from the pp.', '2008-06-09 07:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
