(4759625, 685257, 90387, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a chance moment.  I can''t believe that bird was allowed to sit there. I''m also really liking the facial expresion you captured, and the processing is very nice and earthy.  great job!</td>', 'Wow!  What a chance moment.  I can''t believe that bird was allowed to sit there. I''m also really liking the facial expresion you captured, and the processing is very nice and earthy.  great job!', '2008-06-09 13:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759688, 685416, 90387, '<td valign="top">By far the best of the salt and pepper entries I''ve seen so far.  Very creative way to display them, that''s very pleasing to the eye.  the bowl adds a nice little pop of color, but still looks earthy, and complements the photo. Nicely executed.</td>', 'By far the best of the salt and pepper entries I''ve seen so far.  Very creative way to display them, that''s very pleasing to the eye.  the bowl adds a nice little pop of color, but still looks earthy, and complements the photo. Nicely executed.', '2008-06-09 14:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
