(4759723, 684858, 90387, '<td valign="top">Very clever! :-)</td>', 'Very clever! :-)', '2008-06-09 14:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759730, 684036, 90387, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, and a very interesting subject. I''ve never seen a spider like that! I''m just not sure how this and similar shots fit the challenge.  I''m not the DNMC police though, so I''ll just leave a comment and no score.</td>', 'Cool picture, and a very interesting subject. I''ve never seen a spider like that! I''m just not sure how this and similar shots fit the challenge.  I''m not the DNMC police though, so I''ll just leave a comment and no score.', '2008-06-09 15:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759732, 685380, 92464, '<td valign="top">I really love their exepressions!!<br/> <br/>GREAT pic !!</td>', 'I really love their exepressions!! GREAT pic !!', '2008-06-09 15:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759734, 685324, 58691, '<td valign="top">There is a uniqueness here giving the appearance that the cirrus clouds are the sound waves coming from the chorus. And deep the earthy tones of the image allude to a blues/gospel type sound - as thought there are distinct sounds coming from each, but their 3-part harmony binds the chorus together. <br/> <br/>I get your comparison to the works Edvard Munch, but this is more tangibility and structure here, while yet still portraying immense depth.<br/> <br/>Beautiful!</td>', 'There is a uniqueness here giving the appearance that the cirrus clouds are the sound waves coming from the chorus. And deep the earthy tones of the image allude to a blues/gospel type sound - as thought there are distinct sounds coming from each, but their 3-part harmony binds the chorus together.  I get your comparison to the works Edvard Munch, but this is more tangibility and structure here, while yet still portraying immense depth. Beautiful!', '2008-06-09 15:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759736, 685467, 90387, '<td valign="top">Very emotive image with very nice processing.  Nice detail in the womens face.  I''m not sure what you had to work with, but I would have liked another inch on the bottom to leave a little more of the arm intact.</td>', 'Very emotive image with very nice processing.  Nice detail in the womens face.  I''m not sure what you had to work with, but I would have liked another inch on the bottom to leave a little more of the arm intact.', '2008-06-09 15:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759739, 685236, 92464, '<td valign="top">nice photo !! cute partners!!<br/> <br/>it would be better if u didn''t crop his foot!</td>', 'nice photo !! cute partners!! it would be better if u didn''t crop his foot!', '2008-06-09 15:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759750, 685333, 58691, '<td valign="top">This image is lacking contrast, depth and clarity, but this isn''t a total loss. In the abyss to the left of the salt, there appears to be a nice texture there that would''ve been useful with the proper exposure. For this to better portray partnership, the pepper needs more visibility. With the correct exposure and sharpness, there would be interesting reflections in the caps.</td>', 'This image is lacking contrast, depth and clarity, but this isn''t a total loss. In the abyss to the left of the salt, there appears to be a nice texture there that would''ve been useful with the proper exposure. For this to better portray partnership, the pepper needs more visibility. With the correct exposure and sharpness, there would be interesting reflections in the caps.', '2008-06-09 15:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759761, 684484, 58691, '<td valign="top">There is a lot going here that makes it difficult to focus on the "Partners". The dog appears to be guiding the entire scene and he is the only one facing camera direction. Him/Her eyeing the 8 muffins provides some good humour to the image.  There is a strong disconnect from the human subjects. From this angle, the pregnancy seems to play some important roll in the capture (baby and mama partnership?), but there isn''t enough isolation on her and her belly. The man carrying the herbs and flowers doesn''t appear to be part of the activity.</td>', 'There is a lot going here that makes it difficult to focus on the "Partners". The dog appears to be guiding the entire scene and he is the only one facing camera direction. Him/Her eyeing the 8 muffins provides some good humour to the image.  There is a strong disconnect from the human subjects. From this angle, the pregnancy seems to play some important roll in the capture (baby and mama partnership?), but there isn''t enough isolation on her and her belly. The man carrying the herbs and flowers doesn''t appear to be part of the activity.', '2008-06-09 15:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759764, 685217, 58691, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Your idea/storyboarding designs are excellent. Good use of a shallow DOF as it gives the impressions that the ideas are disappearing into a fog a thoughts. Well done.</td>', 'Very creative. Your idea/storyboarding designs are excellent. Good use of a shallow DOF as it gives the impressions that the ideas are disappearing into a fog a thoughts. Well done.', '2008-06-09 15:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759767, 684439, 58691, '<td valign="top">It''s something about his hair... is it fiberglass or steel? :) Just kidding. Great exposure and focus. The difference in expressions really makes this image interesting.</td>', 'It''s something about his hair... is it fiberglass or steel? :) Just kidding. Great exposure and focus. The difference in expressions really makes this image interesting.', '2008-06-09 15:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759786, 683830, 89341, '<td valign="top">lol, great shot</td>', 'lol, great shot', '2008-06-09 15:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
