(4762763, 683404, 61651, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your top 20 - I really like this image, and am very pleased to see it did well.</td>', 'Congratulations on your top 20 - I really like this image, and am very pleased to see it did well.', '2008-06-11 01:15:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762773, 684863, 67697, '<td valign="top">You know what''s funny... I voted on this during the challenge, gave it a 7, and never even read the title lol.  What I liked about it most was the perspective from under and behind the camera.  I interpreted it as two flowers who were checking out the beautiful scenery together and they just kind of snuck into your photo.  The sky looks great too.  Well I appreciated it although obviously I did not see the original intention lol.</td>', 'You know what''s funny... I voted on this during the challenge, gave it a 7, and never even read the title lol.  What I liked about it most was the perspective from under and behind the camera.  I interpreted it as two flowers who were checking out the beautiful scenery together and they just kind of snuck into your photo.  The sky looks great too.  Well I appreciated it although obviously I did not see the original intention lol.', '2008-06-11 01:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762784, 683830, 49643, '<td valign="top">Really Funny! Nicely executed. Congratulations on Top 5 ranking.</td>', 'Really Funny! Nicely executed. Congratulations on Top 5 ranking.', '2008-06-11 01:19:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762789, 685248, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is SO visually appealing! Congrats on the ribbon and new PB!</td>', 'This is SO visually appealing! Congrats on the ribbon and new PB!', '2008-06-11 01:21:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762790, 683921, 49643, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors &amp; birds! Congratulations on top 10 ranking!</td>', 'Beautiful colors & birds! Congratulations on top 10 ranking!', '2008-06-11 01:21:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762794, 685472, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is such a strong photograph.  Something in it speaks volumes of these two individuals.  Brilliant!!!  Congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'This is such a strong photograph.  Something in it speaks volumes of these two individuals.  Brilliant!!!  Congrats on your ribbon!', '2008-06-11 01:22:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762799, 683777, 49643, '<td valign="top">It is a nice shot &amp; I think voters really underrated this,never mind!</td>', 'It is a nice shot & I think voters really underrated this,never mind!', '2008-06-11 01:23:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762800, 685248, 46870, '<td valign="top">Nice shot<br/>Congratulations :)</td>', 'Nice shotCongratulations :)', '2008-06-11 01:23:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762803, 683287, 67697, '<td valign="top">That is so sweet to see them play together like this.  If this were my boys, it would be that one of them was trying to jerk the swing out from the other lol.  Looooove the sunglasses.  Love the soft dreamy effect too.  You and the girls are going to have so many fun and wonderful photos to look back on one day :)</td>', 'That is so sweet to see them play together like this.  If this were my boys, it would be that one of them was trying to jerk the swing out from the other lol.  Looooove the sunglasses.  Love the soft dreamy effect too.  You and the girls are going to have so many fun and wonderful photos to look back on one day :)', '2008-06-11 01:24:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762826, 685248, 58728, '<td valign="top">Amaaaaaaaaaaaazing!  Congratulations!!!  This is beautiful!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Amaaaaaaaaaaaazing!  Congratulations!!!  This is beautiful! ', '2008-06-11 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762828, 685081, 49643, '<td valign="top">I have given 8 to this shot. Looks underrated by the voters to me. May be a better title may have convinced to the narrow minded voters.</td>', 'I have given 8 to this shot. Looks underrated by the voters to me. May be a better title may have convinced to the narrow minded voters.', '2008-06-11 01:29:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762830, 683830, 25355, '<td valign="top">Certainly deserving of its high placement. Well done.</td>', 'Certainly deserving of its high placement. Well done.', '2008-06-11 01:29:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762846, 685069, 85849, '<td valign="top">I was going to comment on how it''s too bad I didn''t get a better DOF. As I went through the setup, I started to question whether it is a lack of sharpness. Goslings can look fuzzy until viewed large. I still thing the little guy''s out of the DOF, but I''ll look at the original to be sure. <br/> <br/>Anyway, this is what I was going to say...<br/>It was evening and they were in shadow. I had to shoot as they walked by and used an f/8... oh well. Actually, I thought it was a more open aperture to get a fast enough shutter speed.<br/> <br/>I still like the image and my goal was to better my highest finish. Thanks to you guys, I did just that! I also stopped trying to set up shots for these challenges. I was lucky enough to have a shot from the weekend that met the challenge.<br/> <br/>Thanks</td>', 'I was going to comment on how it''s too bad I didn''t get a better DOF. As I went through the setup, I started to question whether it is a lack of sharpness. Goslings can look fuzzy until viewed large. I still thing the little guy''s out of the DOF, but I''ll look at the original to be sure.  Anyway, this is what I was going to say...It was evening and they were in shadow. I had to shoot as they walked by and used an f/8... oh well. Actually, I thought it was a more open aperture to get a fast enough shutter speed. I still like the image and my goal was to better my highest finish. Thanks to you guys, I did just that! I also stopped trying to set up shots for these challenges. I was lucky enough to have a shot from the weekend that met the challenge. Thanks', '2008-06-11 01:31:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762865, 685095, 92732, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much everyone.  This was my very first challenge I entered and look forward to many more.  Kaitllyn is my good friend''s daughter who is 2 and Flirt is a buckskin quarterhorse who I beleive is 3.  Flirt is Kaitllyn''s horse and they both will be growing up together.  Obviously they love each other...Will be using both for more challenges in the future!</td>', 'Thank you so much everyone.  This was my very first challenge I entered and look forward to many more.  Kaitllyn is my good friend''s daughter who is 2 and Flirt is a buckskin quarterhorse who I beleive is 3.  Flirt is Kaitllyn''s horse and they both will be growing up together.  Obviously they love each other...Will be using both for more challenges in the future!', '2008-06-11 01:33:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4762877, 685248, 52549, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, this is defintely the winner. Wonderful, wonderful image. Congratulations, Bragi.</td>', 'Oh yes, this is defintely the winner. Wonderful, wonderful image. Congratulations, Bragi.', '2008-06-11 01:35:43.000000', NULL, 0),
