(4763154, 685248, 31443, '<td valign="top">Congratulations "double" til hamingju, það er ekki skrítið að þessi hafi unnið ekkert annað en frábær!</td>', 'Congratulations "double" til hamingju, það er ekki skrítið að þessi hafi unnið ekkert annað en frábær!', '2008-06-11 04:42:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4763158, 685472, 30807, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - I always feel humble seeing people from this area - life is so tough for them, and it reflects in their faces. I am glad I live in Britain - I am 60, and retired early, and I have a pension - I don''t know how old this couple is, but he seems to have to work, and I can''t imagine how I would manage in his situation. I wish it were better for them. Thanks for showing this image, it makes me want to do something to improve things there - any ideas, anyone? I think the toning is just perfectly right, and personally, I think the roof on the right sets the place more exactly - with it gone, it harder to place them, with it, I can almost see the street they live on</td>', 'Lovely shot - I always feel humble seeing people from this area - life is so tough for them, and it reflects in their faces. I am glad I live in Britain - I am 60, and retired early, and I have a pension - I don''t know how old this couple is, but he seems to have to work, and I can''t imagine how I would manage in his situation. I wish it were better for them. Thanks for showing this image, it makes me want to do something to improve things there - any ideas, anyone? I think the toning is just perfectly right, and personally, I think the roof on the right sets the place more exactly - with it gone, it harder to place them, with it, I can almost see the street they live on', '2008-06-11 04:46:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4763188, 684894, 3214, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting photo, the bareback rider is indeed "in the zone", has a good handle on his excited horse.  I wish the lips/gums weren''t blown out, still a compelling shot and congrats on the top ten!</td>', 'This is a really interesting photo, the bareback rider is indeed "in the zone", has a good handle on his excited horse.  I wish the lips/gums weren''t blown out, still a compelling shot and congrats on the top ten!', '2008-06-11 05:35:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4763191, 685095, 3214, '<td valign="top">Adorable.  Wide angle-distortion and all.  I''m sure you probably already know to use a telephoto when you''re not going for that effect.  Congrats on the placement!</td>', 'Adorable.  Wide angle-distortion and all.  I''m sure you probably already know to use a telephoto when you''re not going for that effect.  Congrats on the placement!', '2008-06-11 05:37:06.000000', NULL, 0),
