(4764151, 685472, 74979, '<td valign="top">I love this, what is it about the faces of individuals so different from our own that sets them apart as a great subject to capture??<br/>the eyes faces, &amp; the expressions speak volumes and I think the duotones did this justice, although I always tend to favor the original, complete with "flaws" and reality of what we saw.<br/> <br/>you were lucky to meet this pair, not for the photo op <i>per se</i>,but for the chance to interact and exchange a bit of yourselves in the process of photgraphing them.  <br/> <br/>Bravo Alfredo!<br/></td>', 'I love this, what is it about the faces of individuals so different from our own that sets them apart as a great subject to capture??the eyes faces, & the expressions speak volumes and I think the duotones did this justice, although I always tend to favor the original, complete with "flaws" and reality of what we saw. you were lucky to meet this pair, not for the photo op per se,but for the chance to interact and exchange a bit of yourselves in the process of photgraphing them.   Bravo Alfredo!', '2008-06-11 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
