(4764314, 684188, 49804, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, seems quite sharp. Lighting is very nice as well, which adds a whole lot to the shot. It could benefit from a little bit of a tighter crop. Things that appeal to the voters are shots that have a "wow" factor. while this is a very solid shot with all the basics right on, it lacks the pop to force voters to give it the higher marks. Messing with the cropping could add a lot as well. Really though it is a very nice shot and you nailed a lot of the technical aspects, keep up the good work. I look forward to watching your portfolio.<br/></td>', 'Nice shot, seems quite sharp. Lighting is very nice as well, which adds a whole lot to the shot. It could benefit from a little bit of a tighter crop. Things that appeal to the voters are shots that have a "wow" factor. while this is a very solid shot with all the basics right on, it lacks the pop to force voters to give it the higher marks. Messing with the cropping could add a lot as well. Really though it is a very nice shot and you nailed a lot of the technical aspects, keep up the good work. I look forward to watching your portfolio.', '2008-06-11 15:34:18.000000', NULL, 0),
