(4764453, 683287, 67237, '<td valign="top">nice soft focus comp...definitely not the kind of focusing that would be appreciated by the dpc community.<br/> <br/>although it is not possible to see their eyes(both eyes), the expressions tell us enough about their mood to make this a good story-teller.<br/> <br/>going back to the technics used here...Ihave an issue with the bg, I mean how it looks after processing, kind of creamy, like a ruined of-camera bokeh.. maybe too much combined sharpenning and NR filtering?</td>', 'nice soft focus comp...definitely not the kind of focusing that would be appreciated by the dpc community. although it is not possible to see their eyes(both eyes), the expressions tell us enough about their mood to make this a good story-teller. going back to the technics used here...Ihave an issue with the bg, I mean how it looks after processing, kind of creamy, like a ruined of-camera bokeh.. maybe too much combined sharpenning and NR filtering?', '2008-06-11 16:30:30.000000', NULL, 0),
