(4764710, 684188, 80904, '<td valign="top">Hey Maggye, here is my CC on this shot.<br/>The water ripple is beautiful, perfect. However the alignment of the ducks is a bit unattractive. I know you have little control on what wild animals do, but perhaps a little more patience would have paid off in this shot. I personally would have liked to see both ducks in the water, or facing each other. Show some interaction or intimacy between them. Show something that conveys emotion. The fact that one is looking at you and the other seems to be staring to nothing doesnt move me much. <br/> <br/>The lighting is perfect though. Just the position of the ducks. I also like the reflections which attributed to the good lighting.<br/> <br/>Good job. 5.4 is not bad at all for your first challenge. I hope you keep entering more and like most of us learn and improve. :)<br/></td>', 'Hey Maggye, here is my CC on this shot.The water ripple is beautiful, perfect. However the alignment of the ducks is a bit unattractive. I know you have little control on what wild animals do, but perhaps a little more patience would have paid off in this shot. I personally would have liked to see both ducks in the water, or facing each other. Show some interaction or intimacy between them. Show something that conveys emotion. The fact that one is looking at you and the other seems to be staring to nothing doesnt move me much.  The lighting is perfect though. Just the position of the ducks. I also like the reflections which attributed to the good lighting. Good job. 5.4 is not bad at all for your first challenge. I hope you keep entering more and like most of us learn and improve. :)', '2008-06-11 18:45:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4764765, 685472, 40718, '<td valign="top">This pic stands out among the zillions I''ve seen on DPC.  Great shot.  Adding to favs.</td>', 'This pic stands out among the zillions I''ve seen on DPC.  Great shot.  Adding to favs.', '2008-06-11 19:13:12.000000', NULL, 0),
