(4766749, 684489, 63269, '<td valign="top">I looked at some of the previous comments...perhaps the eyes need to be a tad darker. But in any case I think this is so beautiful. I love the sepia and the blue! Their rapturous expressions are perfect and the way the darker hair mingles with the curly lighter hair is lovely!</td>', 'I looked at some of the previous comments...perhaps the eyes need to be a tad darker. But in any case I think this is so beautiful. I love the sepia and the blue! Their rapturous expressions are perfect and the way the darker hair mingles with the curly lighter hair is lovely!', '2008-06-12 21:44:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4766755, 684816, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the big black space dominating the top of the photo. Wonderful work! My first thought when I saw this was that both butterflies should have been in color....but that''s just personal opinion. This is nicely done and should have scored higher. :)</td>', 'I love the big black space dominating the top of the photo. Wonderful work! My first thought when I saw this was that both butterflies should have been in color....but that''s just personal opinion. This is nicely done and should have scored higher. :)', '2008-06-12 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
