(4846187, 684701, 73452, '<td valign="top">chris,<br/>Im so pleased and honoured that you even chose to interpret my work!  its such a cool thing to see how others look at your work and say, "hey, i want to show that in my way!"<br/> <br/>back to your photo, i love it.  The eyes are perfect, they dont overpower the image, but are strong enough to make the statement.<br/>sepia is awesome, its my second favorite tone to use besides black and white, they just bring so much more emotion to an image.<br/>The softness you made the skin is so nice and cream-like, really nice.<br/> <br/>all in all, extremely well done, people sometimes dont stretch their minds far enough in challenges and consider anything that isnt suggested in the title, "shoehorn"<br/> <br/>keep up the awesome work, thanks for the comment!</td>', 'chris,Im so pleased and honoured that you even chose to interpret my work!  its such a cool thing to see how others look at your work and say, "hey, i want to show that in my way!" back to your photo, i love it.  The eyes are perfect, they dont overpower the image, but are strong enough to make the statement.sepia is awesome, its my second favorite tone to use besides black and white, they just bring so much more emotion to an image.The softness you made the skin is so nice and cream-like, really nice. all in all, extremely well done, people sometimes dont stretch their minds far enough in challenges and consider anything that isnt suggested in the title, "shoehorn" keep up the awesome work, thanks for the comment!', '2008-07-27 03:00:31.000000', NULL, 0),
