(5725001, 683837, 69008, '<td valign="top">This sure brings back some old memories, good ones.  Thanks. <br/>Stage lighting is always tricky, esp if it is changing as the program goes along. The white on the flute music sheet is right on the money, so I am guessing that the colors are just about true to what was actually there at the moment.<br/> I notice that the percussionist in the top right is the only one making eye contact with the director.</td>', 'This sure brings back some old memories, good ones.  Thanks. Stage lighting is always tricky, esp if it is changing as the program goes along. The white on the flute music sheet is right on the money, so I am guessing that the colors are just about true to what was actually there at the moment. I notice that the percussionist in the top right is the only one making eye contact with the director.', '2009-11-12 23:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
